CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvcase DEFINITION PUBLIC FINAL CREATE PUBLIC.
 PUBLIC SECTION.
 CLASS-METHODS val RETURNING VALUE(r) TYPE i.
 CLASS-METHODS run RETURNING VALUE(rv) TYPE string.
ENDCLASS.
CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvcase IMPLEMENTATION.
 METHOD val. r = 42. ENDMETHOD.
 METHOD run.
 DATA x TYPE i.
 CALL METHOD ('ZCL_GOGEN_T_DYNRECVCASE')=>('val') RECEIVING r = x.
 rv = |{ x }|.
 ENDMETHOD.
ENDCLASS.
